  "description": "The Huffy Stone Mountain 24\" Mountain Bike is built for riders ready to explore neighborhood streets, gravel paths, and light trails. Its durable steel frame provides dependable support, while the front suspension fork helps smooth bumps for a more comfortable, confident ride across changing terrain.\nA Shimano 21-speed drivetrain gives riders a wide gear range for tackling hills, flats, and varied terrain. Easy-to-use twist shifting makes changing gears simple, while front and rear linear pull brakes deliver reliable stopping power for confident control throughout every adventure.\n24\" x 1.95\" knobby all-terrain tires provide dependable traction across pavement, gravel, dirt, and light trails. Designed to fit riders 58–70 inches tall, the Stone Mountain delivers a comfortable fit that helps riders stay in control as they take on longer rides and new adventures.",
